# Accessibility

## HTML
- Semantic elements: `header`, `nav`, `main`, `section`, `article`, `footer`
- One `h1` per page; no skipped heading levels
- `lang` attribute set per locale

## Interactive
- All buttons/links keyboard-focusable with visible focus ring (`focus-visible:ring-2`)
- `aria-label` on icon-only buttons
- `aria-current="page"` on active nav items
- Skip-to-content link in layout

## Images & Media
- Descriptive `alt` on all images
- `aria-hidden="true"` on decorative 3D canvases with text alternative nearby

## Motion
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: disable or simplify animations
- No seizure-inducing flashing

## Contrast
- WCAG AA minimum (4.5:1 body, 3:1 large text)
- Test glass overlays for readability in both themes
